POST http://localhost:8180/realms/tasktracker/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=tasktracker-dev&username=alice&password=alice

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token); %}

###

GET http://localhost:5238/tasks?page=1&pageSize=2&sort=1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET http://localhost:5238/admin/tasks/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

GET http://localhost:5238/tasks/01a17966-e0e2-7e4e-983b-a828fef7bfb6
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

POST http://localhost:5238/tasks/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"Last task"
}

###

PUT http://localhost:5238/tasks/01a1796e-0038-7484-a4ea-9370f2800a8c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title":"That's a finished task",
  "done":true
}

###

DELETE http://localhost:5238/tasks/01a172e0-9656-7e6f-8790-28c3e77dd138
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
